### 49. paid → shipping → 200
PATCH http://localhost:8080/admin/orders/CMD-HWLLXN/status
Authorization: Bearer 3c06995beac15385763fc706bb1f6718ab154c1e30652466df1f4934f3b82a04
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "shipping"}

### 50. shipping → paid → 409 (not allowed)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/admin/orders/CMD-XXXXXX/status
Authorization: Bearer <token admin>
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "paid"}

### 51. shipping → delivered → 200
PATCH http://localhost:8080/admin/orders/CMD-XXXXXX/status
Authorization: Bearer <token admin>
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "delivered"}

### 52. delivered → cancelled → 409 (final state)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/admin/orders/CMD-XXXXXX/status
Authorization: Bearer <token admin>
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "cancelled", "reason": "test"}

### 53. Cancel without reason (another paid order) → 400
PATCH http://localhost:8080/admin/orders/CMD-YYYYYY/status
Authorization: Bearer <token admin>
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "cancelled"}

### 54. Cancel with reason → 200
PATCH http://localhost:8080/admin/orders/CMD-YYYYYY/status
Authorization: Bearer <token admin>
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "cancelled", "reason": "Rupture fournisseur"}

